{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-01/1064911/block/singleImage/3273665/wm/01KFTNC6J73F99HTZXVN7WA1QF.jpg?updatedAt=1795167007\"/><figcaption>事主昏迷被送往博愛醫院搶救，其後證實不治。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>元朗有人墮樓。今早（20日）約9時44分，警方接獲公庵路68號溱柏的保安員報案，指發現一名男子倒臥屋苑平台，懷疑他從高處墮下。救援人員趕至，事主昏迷被送往博愛醫院搶救，其後證實不治。 警方經調查證實事主為屋苑的56歲姓鍾男住戶，相信他由單位墮下。現場沒檢獲遺書，警方將安排為鍾男驗屍確定死因，案件列作自殺。據了解，鍾男有情緒病紀錄。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:44:00.900810+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T09:30:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T22:57:34.664460+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:16.385588+00:00","content_hash":"987f94bd9d0c5768da1c3d252276ba29d913c7cfaa5d5a09dab79d99218e749e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:44:00.900810+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}